          Check the final physical package for the definitive nutrition declaration.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- INGREDIENTS -->
      <div id="ingredients" class="bg-brand-card/80 rounded-[30px] p-7 sm:p-9 border border-brand-green/10">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-4xl">🥛</span>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-accent">What's inside</p>
            <h3 class="display-font text-4xl uppercase">Ingredients</h3>
